                              SEC      
                              LDA   T0   
                              SBC   D0   
                              TAY      
                              LDA   T1   
                              SBC   D1   
                              BCC   uv5   
                              STA   T1   
                              STY   T0   
                              INC   TL   
                    UV5:         
